dsor County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/vermont/windsor-county"],["ARC or PLC in Windsor County","/arc-plc/vermont/windsor-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. May to June came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025, July to August ran 48% of normal on the middle of the grids, and in 2026 so far January to February sits at 62%. Grid 27831 had its driest year in 1965 at 69%.</p>"}
